      "B. The final artifact needs evaluation; add a style reviewer after completion without changing message ownership.",
      "C. The policy worker lacks context; provide the complete trace and permit it to coordinate citation revisions independently.",
      "D. The coordinator has lost mediation; route drafts, corrections, and subsequent assignments through it as recorded state transitions."
